window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Flunking out of my dream school wasn't part of the plan.</b></p> <p>Now, I'm stuck at a place that feels more like a prison than a second chance. There are too many secrets hidden in these halls, and the only thing I care about is surviving the year. But then the murders start—brutal, cold-blooded, and too close to ignore.</p> <p>Suddenly, I'm caught in something far bigger than I ever imagined—a web of lies, power, and danger that's tightening around me. And at the center of it all? Four dangerously irresistible men: Silas Morgan, Dayton Hughes, Kai Reynolds, Levi Thompson. All of them hell-bent on keeping me close.</p> <p>In a world like this, love is lethal, and trust? That might just be what gets me killed.</p> <p>Bound by Shadows <i>is a dark college romance featuring MF, MM, MFM, MMFMM scenes. A complete list of content warnings can be found on the author's website.</i></p>"; 
